//  Sharpens the upscaled 3D view (fsrEasu's output): the robust contrast-adaptive sharpening (RCAS) of AMD FidelityFX
//  Super Resolution 1, the 32-bit version of FsrRcasF() in ffx_fsr1.h, written out in plain GLSL 4.1. The source is
//  in gamma 2.0 (the square root of linear colour); the output is linear again, for the sRGB framebuffer.
//  fsr.rcas.x is the sharpness, FsrRcasCon()'s exp2(-stops).
